🧠 2️⃣8️⃣ FINAL FORMULA CARD

Profit

\[
\boxed{SP-CP}
\]

Loss

\[
\boxed{CP-SP}
\]

Profit %

\[
\boxed{\frac{Profit}{CP}\times100}
\]

Loss %

\[
\boxed{\frac{Loss}{CP}\times100}
\]

SP after profit

\[
\boxed{CP(1+p/100)}
\]

SP after loss

\[
\boxed{CP(1-l/100)}
\]

SP after discount

\[
\boxed{MP(1-d/100)}
\]

Discount %

\[
\boxed{\frac{MP-SP}{MP}\times100}
\]

Two successive discounts

\[
\boxed{a+b-\frac{ab}{100}}
\]

Equal SP, equal \(x%\) profit/loss

\[
\boxed{\frac{x^2}{100}\%\ loss}
\]

False weight

\[
\boxed{\frac{1-x}{x}\times100}
\]


