🧠 MEMORY TRICK

Remember the three base prices:

CP → Buying price
MP → Tagged price
SP → Final selling price

And the order:

CP
 ↓
MP
 ↓ discount
SP

Profit/loss compares:

CP ↔ SP

Discount compares:

MP ↔ SP

🔥 This distinction prevents many MCQ mistakes.


